1
00:00:00,316 --> 00:00:02,526
(Leonard:)I'm sorry,
I should have mentioned this earlier.

2
00:00:02,693 --> 00:00:04,403
(Howard:)My last name is Wolowitz.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:07,160
(Christie:)Oh. That's so cool.

4
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:09,703
(Christie:)My first Jew.

5
00:00:12,828 --> 00:00:16,248
(Sheldon:)I imagine there aren't
very many kosher cornhuskers.

6
00:00:18,584 --> 00:00:21,294
- But you're still taking me shopping?
- Anything you want.

7
00:00:21,462 --> 00:00:23,802
(Christie:)Okay, I'll go pack my stuff.

8
00:00:26,383 --> 00:00:29,933
(Howard:)When they perfect human cloning,
I'm gonna order 12 of those.

9
00:00:31,972 --> 00:00:33,762
(Leonard:)Howard, can't you see she's using you?

10
00:00:33,933 --> 00:00:37,223
Who cares? Last night,
she pulled off her blouse and I wept.

11
00:00:37,394 --> 00:00:39,064
Look, Howard, I know her, okay?

12
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:42,650
(Penny:)She'll have sex with anyone
as long as they keep buying her things.

13
00:00:43,067 --> 00:00:44,527
- Really?
- Yeah.

14
00:00:44,693 --> 00:00:46,073
(Howard:)Yay.

15
00:00:48,614 --> 00:01:00,024
(Howard:)If you'll excuse me,
I have some bar mitzvah bonds to cash.

